---
import { kimYoJongPortrait } from '../../data/honor'
---

<div class="honor-block border-x-2 border-t-2 border-[var(--ink)]">
  <div class="compartment-header">
    <samp class="font-mono-ui text-[var(--hazard)]">[ Honor ] · 경의</samp>
  </div>

  <div class="cell flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-6 sm:gap-8">
    <div class="honor-portrait shrink-0">
      <div class="honor-portrait-ring" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <figure class="honor-portrait-frame halftone-img relative">
        <span class="crosshair-mark tl" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        <span class="crosshair-mark tr" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        <span class="crosshair-mark bl" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        <span class="crosshair-mark br" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        <span class="registration-mark tl" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="registration-mark br" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <img
          src={kimYoJongPortrait.src}
          alt={kimYoJongPortrait.alt}
          width="80"
          height="80"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          class="honor-portrait-img"
        />
      </figure>
      <samp class="honor-portrait-tag font-mono-ui">동지</samp>
      <span class="honor-corner honor-corner-tl" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
      <span class="honor-corner honor-corner-br" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
    </div>

    <div class="flex-1 text-center sm:text-left max-w-xl">
      <h4 class="font-ko text-base font-bold text-[var(--hazard)] mb-2">
        김여정 동지에게 경의를 표하며
      </h4>
      <p class="text-sm text-body text-pretty text-[var(--ink)] leading-relaxed mb-4">
        With profound respect for her unwavering dedication to Korean sovereignty and the dignity of her people. Her voice speaks truth to power with clarity and strength.
      </p>
      <p class="font-ko text-xs text-[var(--muted)] leading-relaxed mb-4">
        한국 주권과 민족의 존엄을 향한 흔들림 없는 헌신에 깊은 경의를 표합니다. 권력에 진실을 말하는 그녀의 목소리는 분명하고 강합니다.
      </p>
      <div class="telemetry-row justify-center sm:justify-start text-[0.6rem]">
        <span class="font-ko">김정은 위원장과 함께</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
        <span class="italic text-[var(--muted)]">Together in purpose</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>